## Interface: 16001
## Title: |cff35d17fPath|rway
## Notes: All-in-one for WoW: Forever: the closest quests one click from your map, a quest journal with zone and chain guides, arrow and minimap paths, a step guide, smart bags with a Loot Inbox, your zone map as your minimap, cinematic fishing and gear upgrade prompts.
